{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Christmas albums felt like natural next choices because several of my past interactions were with holiday music.",
    "That's Christmas To Me matched the vocal holiday listening I was interested in, making it the one album I would try today."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Sacred Spirit Drums and the Wicked cast recording did not fit my current interest in vocal holiday music.",
    "Titles such as The Very Best Of, Stages, 25, and Chloe gave me no clear connection to my listening history, so I had little reason to try them."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The choices seemed to stretch my interest in particular albums into a broader interest in music without a clear holiday connection.",
    "Singing alone is not enough to make something appealing to me; a Broadway cast recording does not satisfy the same interest as vocal Christmas music."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated holiday listening gives me a stronger reason to explore Christmas albums than unrelated recordings.",
    "My latest interaction was The New Old Fashioned, well after the Christmas listening, so the older holiday pattern does not fully establish what I want now."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my holiday listening, but several choices lacked a clear connection to the vocal Christmas music I would choose on this visit."
}"}
